  "body": "Properties offering this high level of architectural design, 2 living areas, 3 full bathrooms, top school zones, and fee-free freehold ownership-paired with a vendor ready to meet the market-are exceptionally rare. This is a must-see!\r\nSearching for architecturally designed space, sunshine, and top-tier schooling in Bucklands Beach? With a motivated vendor actively listening to the market and ready to sell, this is your opportunity to secure an exceptional family home. You are just a short walk to Macleans College, Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI), and local beaches. Location truly does not get better than this!\r\n\r\nArchitectural Elegance & Dual Living Spaces: Features 5 double bedrooms and 2 distinct living areas—offering complete versatility for large families, multi-generational living, guests, or working from home.\r\n\r\nModern Designer Kitchen: A true chef’s dream featuring sleek modern finishes, top-quality fittings, and superior craftsmanship.\r\n\r\n3 Full Bathrooms: Thoughtfully designed with 3 full, beautifully appointed bathrooms (including a private master ensuite) to eliminate the morning rush!\r\n\r\nSecure Garage & Extra Parking: Internal access garage with extra storage space, plus a dedicated off-street car park.\r\n\r\nQuality & Comfort: Built with precision craftsmanship and high-end finishes throughout, complemented by a pre-installed heat pump for year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nFreehold Freedom – Total Independence: Enjoy total peace of mind with absolute Freehold title ownership and complete control over your quality property.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Convenience at Your Doorstep: Beyond the world-class school zones, you’ll love the vibrant lifestyle on offer. Enjoy fast access to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Howick Village, Half Moon Bay Marina, beautiful local beaches, and easy public transport links.\r\n\r\nCall us today to secure your private viewing!",
